flowchart TD
  Gmail[Authorized Gmail thread metadata] --> History[Latest message direction]
  Mac[Read-only local Messages snapshot] --> History
  History --> DB[Owner-private Attention Desk database]
  DB --> UI[DreyOS Attention Desk]
  UI --> Original[Open original or find sender and timestamp]
  UI --> Important[Important]
  UI --> NotImportant[Not important]
  UI --> Ignored[Ignored]
  Important --> DB
  NotImportant --> DB
  Ignored --> DB
  New[New message version] --> Review[Return to needs review]
  Review --> DB
  UI --> Learn[Diagram, narration, transcript, practice]
  Boundary[No paid model calls, automatic replies or inbox mutations]
